<title>PORTUGAL: Yield 5.2153 on Portuguese one-year bills.</title>
<headline>Yield 5.2153 on Portuguese one-year bills.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield fell to 5.2153 percent, from 5.2229 percent previously, at the Institute for Public Credit Management's sale of 364-day bills, the Bank of Portugal said.</p>
<p>The Institute placed billion all of the 15 billion escudos on offer. The last such sale was on Aug 11.</p>
<p>--LISBON BUREAU 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
